nearshare (1.1.0~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Redesigned main window: click a device or drop files on it to send,
    the PIN is shown while sending, transfers can be cancelled, and
    incoming files can be accepted from the notification.
  * New Preferences (device name, download folder, start at login) and
    About dialogs.
  * Faster start: bytecode is compiled at install time and the desktop
    integration checks no longer block the first frame.
  * The receiver notices when the sender gives up before an answer.
  * See CHANGELOG.md for the full list.

